  "title": "American Financial Group, Inc. Declares Quarterly Dividend",
  "summary": "CINCINNATI --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 1, 2026-- American Financial Group, Inc. (NYSE: AFG) announced that it has declared a regular dividend of $0.88 per share of American Financial Group Common Stock. The dividend is payable on July 24, 2026, to holders of record on July 15, 2026.",
